<del></del></span> Celestial Dungeon Gear for Protection Warriors</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available from Celestial Dungeons in Phase 5 of Mists of Pandaria Classic. Keep in mind that these items are likely to be replaced by their Normal and Heroic raid counterparts. With that in mind, this is not a true "best in slot" list, and instead should serve as a rough guideline for what to keep an eye on from Celestial Dungeons.<br/>
<br/>Your purchase Celestial Items using <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=3416/august-stone-cluster">
<span>
