<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Protection Warriors</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. World Bosses, like <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>, will offer raid-equivalent loot and will serve as this expansion's <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=5600/baradin-hold">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin Hold</span></a> equivalent.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-celestial-court">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pet_tigergodcub.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> The Celestial Court</span></h3>Chi-ji, Yu'Lon, Xuen, and Niuzao all share a loot pool and drop item level 553 Tier 16.<br/>
<br/>Make sure to have Protection as loot spec when killing these bosses, as tank tier is very valuable for Protection Warriors, but if you accidentally find yourself getting the DPS tier, it will still be better than pretty much anything else you can get before stepping into raid.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99202/handguards-of-the-prehistoric-marauder">
<img alt="Handguards of the Prehistoric Marauder" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_plate_raidwarrior_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Handguards of the Prehistoric Marauder</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99195/legguards-of-the-prehistoric-marauder">
<img alt="Legguards of the Prehistoric Marauder" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidwarrior_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legguards of the Prehistoric Marauder</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="ordos">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_axe_1h_firelandsraid_d_02.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Ordos, Fire God of the Yaungol</span></h3>Ordos drops some decent pieces, such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105805/dominiks-casque-of-raging-flame">
<img alt="Dominik's Casque of Raging Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dominik's Casque of Raging Flame</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105769/omegals-crushing-carapace">
<img alt="Omegal's Crushing Carapace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Omegal's Crushing Carapace</span></a>. These are fairly rare, but can be nice items until you step into raid, as they are equivalent to Normal difficulty items.<ul class="exclude-units">
